  "slug": "chia-and-cocoa-energy-balls",
  "title": "Chia and Cocoa Energy Balls",
  "blurb": "No-bake energy balls with dates, cashews and chia seeds, rolled in cocoa powder.",
  "steps": [
    "Put the dates, cashews, chia seeds and half the cocoa powder into a food processor and pulse until the mixture starts to clump together.",
    "Add the water and blend until the mixture forms a sticky dough that holds together when pressed.",
    "Scoop out portions and roll into eight balls with damp hands.",
    "Put the remaining cocoa powder on a plate and roll each ball in it to coat.",
    "Chill in the fridge for at least 30 minutes before eating."
